      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "DrMundoQ",
        "name": "Infected Bonesaw",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Dr. Mundo throws an infected bonesaw, dealing damage to the first enemy hit based on their current health and slowing them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Dr. Mundo hurls his bonesaw, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">20/22.5/25/27.5/30% current Health magic damage</span> to the first enemy hit and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 40% for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If the bonesaw hits a champion or monster, Dr. Mundo restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">50/60/70/80/90 Health</span>. If it hits a non-champion or non-monster, Dr. Mundo instead restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">25/30/35/40/45 Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a minimum of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">80/130/180/230/280 magic damage</span>, and a maximum of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">250/325/400/475/550 magic damage</span> to jungle monsters.</span>",
