        "bodyHtml": "Dr. Mundo pumps himself with chemicals, gaining <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">15/20/25% of his missing Health as max Health</span>, <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">15/25/35% Move Speed</span>, and regenerating <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">20/40/60% max Health</span> over 10 seconds.<br /><br />At Rank 3, both healing effects are increased by an additional 5% per nearby enemy champion.",
